{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25402","headline":"秋日美晴郡楼闲眺寄荆南张书记 · 李德裕","name":"秋日美晴郡楼闲眺寄荆南张书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高槛凉风起，清川旭景开。\n秋声向野去，爽气自山来。\n霄外鸿初返，檐间燕已归。\n不因烟雨夕，何处梦阳台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}